    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Cumulative frequency is the running total of frequencies up to a certain point in grouped data. It is found by adding each frequency to the total of the previous frequencies, showing how many data values lie below or at a certain boundary.</p>",
